    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes Clontarf are thrilled to bring 121 The Stiles Road to the market. This elegant extended semi-detached home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a truly outstanding family home. This is a genuinely phenomenal opportunity to acquire a substantial 4 bedroom semi-detached property in the heart of Clontarf, that is well-connected to all transport links and local amenities.\r\n\r\nNumber 121 comes to the market in turn-key condition having been substantially extended and upgraded in 2019 and very well-maintained through its ownership. This well-proportioned property comprises of a total of 275 sq m / 2,960 sq ft of internal living accommodation. The property benefits further from a west facing rear garden and a driveway to the front with electric gates and ample car parking. \r\n\r\nSituated in  Clontarf - a mature and settled area, the location is second to none. Clontarf Promenade and cycle track are nearby and both Killester and Clontarf Village with their  excellent selection of restaurants and boutiques are nearby. The area is well- serviced by public transport –  there are 2 DART stations within walking distance and  a quality bus corridor operating along the Clontarf Road providing efficient links to the City Centre. In addition to this, there are an abundance of excellent schools and sporting facilities in the immediate vicinity as well as St. Anne’s Park and Dollymount Strand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor:\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nWith engineered Herringbone flooring and understairs storage / cloakroom\r\n\r\nGuest WC:\r\nFully tiled with WC and wash hand basin\r\n\r\nReception Room:\r\nLarge bright room to the front of the house with Riva fireplace with limestone surround and carpet flooring\r\n\r\nFamily Room:\r\nWith engineered Herringbone flooring and double doors to:\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room / Living Room:\r\nGenerous dining area overlooking the rear garden and ample living space with feature Dru fire. Aluminium folding and sliding doors to rear garden and patio. Kitchen fitted with wall and floor units, elegant Quartz counter tops and breakfast bar with 4 ring gas hob and extractor fan. Tiled splashback, recessed lighting and engineered Herringbone flooring. Smeg integrated double oven, dishwasher x2, fridge, microwave, coffee machine and Quooker tap\r\n\r\nUtility Room:\r\nWith engineered Herringbone flooring and shelving. Plumbing for washing machine and dryer and free-standing American fridge / freezer\r\n\r\nOffice:\r\nSituated to the front of the house with engineered Herringbone flooring and shelving\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nLaundry Room:\r\nWith storage and washing machine\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: \r\nA large double bedroom suite to the rear of the property with walk-in wardrobe / dressing room, plush carpet and built-in wardrobe \r\n\r\nEn Suite:\r\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin with storage and walk-in rain head shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nLarge double bedroom to rear of the house with plush carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nDouble bedroom to front of the house with walk-in wardrobe and plush carpet flooring\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nStylish bathroom with. WC, wash hand basin with storage and walk-in rain head shower\r\n\r\nSecond Floor / Attic\r\nBedroom 4:\r\nAn incredible double bedroom with under-eaves storage and built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn Suite:\r\nWith WC, wash hand basin and walk-in shower\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nA private west facing rear garden with synthetic low maintenance grass off the patio area rear vehicular laneway access. To the front is a large driveway with ample parking, a walled garden and electric gates.\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nElectronically controlled security gates to the front with off-street parking for up to three cars\r\nLow maintenance west facing rear garden with vehicular laneway access\r\nReinforced steel hall door with finger print entry \r\nUnderground heating (ground floor)\r\nFully alarmed\r\nAeroco Air Filtration System\r\nIntercom\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: B\r\nBER No. 119921526\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 79.14 kWh/m²/yr \r\n\r\nViewing:\r\nViewing By Appointment with Paul Grimes / Linda O’ Brien. Contact linda@grimes.ie or contact the office on 01 8530630 to request a viewing. An assigned time on Wednesday or Saturday are the viewing times. \r\n\r\nContents - Included: carpets, curtains, blinds, Slamp light fittings, integrated and non-integrated appliances and all standard fixtures and fittings, bar stools x6, bed frames and matresses (not including master bedroom), navy sofa (family room)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning 4 bed extended and architecturally designed home in the heart of Clontarf\r\nApprox. 275 sq m / 2,960 sq ft \r\nLow maintenance west facing rear garden with rear vehicular access\r\nDesirable and incredibly well-connected location in Clontarf \r\nFinished to the highest standards with high-spec finishes throughout\r\nCCTV system"
      },
